{"dur":555,"ev":[{"t":3,"type":"voice","id":"n01","dlg":false,"sub":"Every morning, a mirror shows you who you are."},{"t":11,"type":"voice","id":"n02","dlg":false,"sub":"This one showed Theo who he was going to be."},{"t":15,"type":"voice","id":"t01","dlg":true,"sub":"Huh.","who":"Theo"},{"t":18.6,"type":"voice","id":"t02","dlg":true,"sub":"Oh. Hi?","who":"Theo"},{"t":22,"type":"voice","id":"n03","dlg":false,"sub":"Theo was twenty-four. The man in the glass was not."},{"t":39.2,"type":"voice","id":"n04","dlg":false,"sub":"He did what anyone would do. He tested it."},{"t":43,"type":"voice","id":"t03","dlg":true,"sub":"Left hand.","who":"Theo"},{"t":46.2,"type":"voice","id":"n05","dlg":false,"sub":"Fun fact: mirrors don’t really swap left and right. They swap front and back. That’s why the words on your T-shirt come out backwards."},{"t":54.4,"type":"voice","id":"n06","dlg":false,"sub":"And the face in a mirror is always a little out of date."},{"t":58,"type":"voice","id":"n07","dlg":false,"sub":"Stand a metre from the glass, and the light takes about seven billionths of a second to come back to you."},{"t":64.4,"type":"voice","id":"n08","dlg":false,"sub":"Theo’s mirror was running about ten years ahead."},{"t":68.2,"type":"voice","id":"n09","dlg":false,"sub":"He studied the man. Same nose. Same hair, less of it. Tired eyes."},{"t":73.6,"type":"voice","id":"n10","dlg":false,"sub":"An office badge. And in the corner, his cello. Shut, and dusty."},{"t":81,"type":"voice","id":"t04","dlg":true,"sub":"Okay. Phone camera.","who":"Theo"},{"t":84.4,"type":"voice","id":"t05","dlg":true,"sub":"Normal.","who":"Theo"},{"t":88.6,"type":"voice","id":"n11","dlg":false,"sub":"The mirror in the hallway was normal too. Only the bathroom one knew."},{"t":100.8,"type":"voice","id":"t06","dlg":true,"sub":"Nan, does your mirror ever show you older?","who":"Theo"},{"t":105.4,"type":"voice","id":"a01","dlg":true,"sub":"Every morning, love. It’s called being seventy-eight.","who":"Nan"},{"t":110.8,"type":"voice","id":"t07","dlg":true,"sub":"No, a lot older. Like, ten years.","who":"Theo"},{"t":114.8,"type":"voice","id":"a02","dlg":true,"sub":"Ah. And what’s he like?","who":"Nan"},{"t":118.2,"type":"voice","id":"t08","dlg":true,"sub":"Tired. Like he gave up on something.","who":"Theo"},{"t":122.4,"type":"voice","id":"a03","dlg":true,"sub":"Then he’s a stranger. You haven’t met him yet.","who":"Nan"},{"t":127.8,"type":"voice","id":"n12","dlg":false,"sub":"Psychologists asked over nineteen thousand people about their personalities."},{"t":133.6,"type":"voice","id":"n13","dlg":false,"sub":"They expected to change very little in the next ten years. But they said they’d changed a lot in the last ten."},{"t":140.6,"type":"voice","id":"n14","dlg":false,"sub":"We always think we’re nearly finished. It’s called the end of history illusion."},{"t":151.6,"type":"voice","id":"n15","dlg":false,"sub":"So Theo started running experiments."},{"t":158.6,"type":"voice","id":"n16","dlg":false,"sub":"He walked to work instead of taking the bus."},{"t":176.6,"type":"voice","id":"n17","dlg":false,"sub":"The next morning, the man in the glass stood a little straighter."},{"t":183,"type":"voice","id":"n18","dlg":false,"sub":"He opened the cello. Ten minutes a night. His neighbours were very patient."},{"t":201.4,"type":"voice","id":"n19","dlg":false,"sub":"In the glass, the cello case was open."},{"t":205.9,"type":"voice","id":"t09","dlg":true,"sub":"Did you see that?","who":"Theo"},{"t":213,"type":"voice","id":"n20","dlg":false,"sub":"Here’s something odd about brains. When people imagine themselves in ten years, their brains respond a bit like they’re thinking about someone else."},{"t":222.4,"type":"voice","id":"n21","dlg":false,"sub":"In one experiment, people met an aged picture of themselves first."},{"t":227.2,"type":"voice","id":"n22","dlg":false,"sub":"Then they set aside more than twice as much for retirement."},{"t":232.2,"type":"voice","id":"n23","dlg":false,"sub":"Theo had the full-size version. Every morning."},{"t":241,"type":"voice","id":"n24","dlg":false,"sub":"New habits take about sixty-six days, on average, to become automatic."},{"t":246.6,"type":"voice","id":"n25","dlg":false,"sub":"Some took eighteen. Some took over two hundred."},{"t":262.6,"type":"voice","id":"n26","dlg":false,"sub":"On day sixty-six, he took the cello up to the roof."},{"t":289,"type":"voice","id":"a04","dlg":true,"sub":"Not bad at all, love!","who":"Nan"},{"t":292,"type":"voice","id":"t10","dlg":true,"sub":"Thank you, Nan!","who":"Theo"},{"t":309,"type":"voice","id":"n27","dlg":false,"sub":"On day seventy, the mirror showed the bathroom. Just the bathroom."},{"t":314.6,"type":"voice","id":"t11","dlg":true,"sub":"Hello?","who":"Theo"},{"t":317.4,"type":"voice","id":"t12","dlg":true,"sub":"Where are you?","who":"Theo"},{"t":320.8,"type":"voice","id":"n28","dlg":false,"sub":"No man. No badge. No cello. Ten years from now, nobody lived here."},{"t":331,"type":"voice","id":"t13","dlg":true,"sub":"He’s gone. The one in the mirror is gone.","who":"Theo"},{"t":335.2,"type":"voice","id":"a05","dlg":true,"sub":"Where did he go?","who":"Nan"},{"t":338.2,"type":"voice","id":"t14","dlg":true,"sub":"I don’t know. Nowhere.","who":"Theo"},{"t":341.6,"type":"voice","id":"a06","dlg":true,"sub":"Or somewhere else. Did you look properly?","who":"Nan"},{"t":351,"type":"voice","id":"n29","dlg":false,"sub":"He hadn’t vanished. He’d moved out."},{"t":359.2,"type":"voice","id":"t15","dlg":true,"sub":"Port Alder.","who":"Theo"},{"t":362.6,"type":"voice","id":"n30","dlg":false,"sub":"Bodies are always moving out, too. Your red blood cells only last about four months."},{"t":369,"type":"voice","id":"n31","dlg":false,"sub":"But most of the neurons in the outer layer of your brain are as old as you are. Some of you stays."},{"t":394.6,"type":"voice","id":"n32","dlg":false,"sub":"Port Alder had an orchestra. The orchestra had auditions."},{"t":400,"type":"voice","id":"t16","dlg":true,"sub":"Okay. Okay.","who":"Theo"},{"t":421.4,"type":"voice","id":"n33","dlg":false,"sub":"On his last morning, Theo didn’t check the mirror."},{"t":425.2,"type":"voice","id":"n34","dlg":false,"sub":"He’d seen enough to start. The rest, he wanted to find out by getting there."},{"t":433.4,"type":"voice","id":"a07","dlg":true,"sub":"You send me a postcard, love.","who":"Nan"},{"t":436.8,"type":"voice","id":"t17","dlg":true,"sub":"I think I already did.","who":"Theo"},{"t":467,"type":"voice","id":"p01","dlg":true,"sub":"Whenever you’re ready.","who":"Panel"},{"t":482.4,"type":"voice","id":"p02","dlg":true,"sub":"Thank you. We’ll be in touch.","who":"Panel"},{"t":486.8,"type":"voice","id":"n35","dlg":false,"sub":"And they were."},{"t":507,"type":"voice","id":"n36","dlg":false,"sub":"Ten years later, in a flat by the sea, a man stepped up to a mirror."},{"t":512.6,"type":"voice","id":"n37","dlg":false,"sub":"It showed him at forty-four."},{"t":518.2,"type":"voice","id":"t18","dlg":true,"sub":"Hi, you.","who":"Theo"},{"t":522.4,"type":"voice","id":"n38","dlg":false,"sub":"He didn’t ask what he’d become. He knew the trick now. It gets decided every morning."},{"t":14.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":18.150000000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":42.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":80.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":83.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":100.35,"type":"chime"},{"t":104.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":110.35,"type":"chime"},{"t":114.35,"type":"chime"},{"t":117.75,"type":"chime"},{"t":121.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":205.45000000000002,"type":"chime"},{"t":288.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":291.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":314.15000000000003,"type":"chime"},{"t":316.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":330.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":334.75,"type":"chime"},{"t":337.75,"type":"chime"},{"t":341.15000000000003,"type":"chime"},{"t":358.75,"type":"chime"},{"t":399.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":432.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":436.35,"type":"chime"},{"t":466.55,"type":"chime"},{"t":481.95,"type":"chime"},{"t":517.75,"type":"chime"},{"t":151.05,"type":